factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and slides say the event was held 'நேற்று' in the reel script, which matches the article, so no issue there; however the reel_script states the Udhayanidhi birthday celebration was 'தி மு க சார்பில்' in Tharamangalam, consistent with the article — no problem.
  The slides_spec line 'டவுன் பஞ்சாயத்து தலைவர் பாபு தலைமையில் நடந்தது' places Babu's leadership under the 'மக்களுக்கு என்ன?' slide and mixes his role with the food distribution, combining two separate facts into one line.
