  The reel_script omits the important fact that the Ilaignar Ani distribution and the named organisers/councillors participated; more importantly it omits the names of the deputy secretary Selvani, treasurer Sekaran and the municipal councillors who took part, which the article reports as attendees.
  The reel_script's 'இளைஞரணி சார்பில் ... மாணவர்களுக்கு இனிப்பு, நோட்டு, பேனா வழங்கப்பட்டன' is ungrammatical in Tamil mixing singular/plural subject agreement with the earlier sentences, making the sentence's meaning unclear.
